Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Re: [stan-users] Re: employing a ragged array of cutpoints
Message-ID: <QZD1oTrDE2s.CATvLr835c0J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <QZD1oTrDE2s.kUDiGeQ6H0kJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <QZD1oTrDE2s.AL0ThUGMZ6UJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <QZD1oTrDE2s.kUDiGeQ6H0kJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
