I later discovered that you can override this by specifying -f or --force in the call to cppcheck, but the report was basically the same.

> 2.  Shifting by negative.
> The number one false positive is this one from Eigen:
>
>   y << -0.1, 0.0, 1.0;<--- Shifting by a negative value.
